 top:41.79pt; line-height:13.41pt;">the</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="letter-spacing:0.99pt; left:271.69pt; top:41.79pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:276.01pt; top:41.79pt; line-height:13.41pt;">GREEN</span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="letter-spacing:0.99pt; left:318.68pt; top:41.79pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:323pt; top:41.79pt; line-height:13.41pt;">CHECK</span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="letter-spacing:0.99pt; left:365.67pt; top:41.79pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:369.99pt; top:41.79pt; line-height:13.41pt;">mark.</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="letter-spacing:0.99pt; left:399.99pt; top:41.79pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:404.31pt; top:41.79pt; line-height:13.41pt;">To</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="letter-spacing:0.99pt; left:418.31pt; top:41.79pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:422.63pt; top:41.79pt; line-height:13.41pt;">navigate </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:55.59pt; line-height:13.41pt;">back to the Home page, close the existing page.</span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:231.85pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="311"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,309.6376 L624.5,309.6376 L-0.5,309.6376 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-miterlimit="10.66667" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:417.89pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:93.34pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="126"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,124.9558 L624.5,124.9558 L-0.5,124.9558 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-miterlimit="10.66667" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:513.85pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:167.3pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="225"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,223.5667 L624.5,223.5667 L-0.5,223.5667 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="awdiv awpage" style="width:612pt; height:792pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:36pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,26.3pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:311.3pt; top:14.13pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Sourcelead – Candidates Module</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:742pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,15pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:0pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Quick Reference Guide</span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:462.44pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">6</span><div class="awdiv" style="left:-1.45pt; top:0pt; width:470.9pt; height:0pt; border-top:solid 1.5pt #000000;"></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="top:13.8pt;"><a name="_Toc508955303" style="left:0pt; top:0pt;"></a><span class="awspan awtext001" style="font-size:16pt; left:0pt; top:12.52pt; line-height:17.88pt;">Viewing the Candidate Summary</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:47.2pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">You can view the Candidate Summary by clicking on the binocular icon next to the </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Name. </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:88.59pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:255.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">The below page is displayed with three tabs – </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:246.15pt; top:255.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Quickview, Detailed View, and </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:0pt; top:269.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Timeline.</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:371.19pt;"><a name="_Toc508955304" style="left:0pt; top:0pt;"></a><span class="awspan awtext001" style="font-size:14pt; left:0pt; top:12.46pt; line-height:15.64pt;">Candidate Summary – Quickview</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:402.29pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Under the </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:56.03pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Quickview </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:118.73pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">tab, basic details of the candidate like Name, Phone number, </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Skills, Certifications and Education get displayed. The candidates profile completion </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">percentage is displayed under the icon, in the middle of the page.</span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:160.59pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:251.8pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="338"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,336.2333 L624.5,336.2333 L-0.5,336.2333 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="awdiv awpage" style="width:612pt; height:792pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:36pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,26.3pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:311.3pt; top:14.13pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Sourcelead – Candidates Module</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:742pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,15pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:0pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Quick Reference Guide</span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:462.44pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">7</span><div class="awdiv" style="left:-1.45pt; top:0pt; width:470.9pt; height:0pt; border-top:solid 1.5pt #000000;"></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="top:271.8pt;"><a name="_Toc508955305" style="left:0pt; top:0pt;"></a><span class="awspan awtext001" style="font-size:14pt; left:0pt; top:12.46pt; line-height:15.64pt;">Candidate Summary – Detailed View</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:302.9pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">You can view the complete details of the candidate under the </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:327.55pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Detailed View. </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:411.58pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">The </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Candidate information like Employment Type, Experience, Notice Period , Email, Phone </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">number, Rate etc. are displayed.</span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:254.6pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.14pt; top:-0.14pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="624" height="340"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(0.1866667,0.1866667)"><path d="M-0.09333333,-0.09333333 L624.0933,-0.09333333 L624.0933,-0.09333333 L624.0933,339.56 L624.0933,339.56 L-0.09333333,339.56 Z" stroke-width="0.1866667" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:430.09pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:257.8pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="346"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,344.2334 L624.5,344.2334 L-0.5,344.2334 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="awdiv awpage" style="width:612pt; height:792pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:36pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,26.3pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:311.3pt; top:14.13pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Sourcelead – Candidates Module</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:742pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,15pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:0pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Quick Reference Guide</span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:462.44pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">8</span><div class="awdiv" style="left:-1.45pt; top:0pt; width:470.9pt; height:0pt; border-top:solid 1.5pt #000000;"></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><span class="awspan awtext005" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Profile Tab</span><div class="awdiv" style="top:16.8pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">You can view, edit, update, or remove the candidate details under this tab. The </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">removed candidate status will be inactive. Click on </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:270.8pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Edit Skill </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:324.81pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">to add or update the skills. </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">To update the Immigration Status click </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:207.43pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Edit Visa.</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:319.2pt;"><span class="awspan awtext005" style="left:0pt; top:12.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Resume</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:348pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">The attached resumes of the candidate will be displayed in the list. Click </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:385.54pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Add Resume</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:458.89pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">and </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:23.36pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Add resume</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:92.71pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> pop-up will be displayed. You can download, view, edit and delete the </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">resume. </span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:88.8pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:42.9pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:258.2pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="346"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,344.7667 L624.5,344.7667 L-0.5,344.7667 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="awdiv awpage" style="width:612pt; height:792pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:36pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,26.3pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:311.3pt; top:14.13pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Sourcelead – Candidates Module</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:742pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,15pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:0pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Quick Reference Guide</span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:462.44pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">9</span><div class="awdiv" style="left:-1.45pt; top:0pt; width:470.9pt; height:0pt; border-top:solid 1.5pt #000000;"></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="top:259.5pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:29.33pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Browse File </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:100.02pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">to select resume from the computer and by clicking on </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:390.82pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Add </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:417.48pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">the </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">candidate resume is added to the list. The pop-up window gets closed.</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:548.1pt;"><span class="awspan awtext005" style="left:0pt; top:12.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Employers</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:576.9pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Under this tab, the current and previous employment details of the candidates will be </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">displayed. Click </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:86.7pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Add Employer</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:168.05pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> and then </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:221.43pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Add Employer</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:302.77pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> pop-up will be displayed. Click </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:0pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Edit/Delete</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:62.02pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> in order to update or delete the existing employers. Click </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:368.18pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Search</span><span class="awspan awtext003" 