56.88pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">13</span><div class="awdiv" style="left:-1.45pt; top:0pt; width:470.9pt; height:0pt; border-top:solid 1.5pt #000000;"></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="top:261pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click on </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:46.01pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Document Type</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:136.03pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> and select </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:197.4pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">document type</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:282.74pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> from the dropdown. Click </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:422.13pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Add</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:445.45pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> to </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">request more documents. Click </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:168.73pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Send</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:198.07pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> then the document request will be sent to the </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">candidate and it will be added in the documents list. </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:302.4pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click Description --</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:316.2pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">You can enter the description and click </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:209.46pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Close</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:242.13pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">. Particular row will be removed. Click </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Cancel</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:39.35pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> and the pop up will be closed. </span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:257.6pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="345"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,343.9667 L624.5,343.9667 L-0.5,343.9667 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:429.59pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:253.25pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="340"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,338.1667 L624.5,338.1667 L-0.5,338.1667 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="awdiv awpage" style="width:612pt; height:792pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:36pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,26.3pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:311.3pt; top:14.13pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Sourcelead – Candidates Module</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:742pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,15pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:0pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Quick Reference Guide</span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:456.88pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">14</span><div class="awdiv" style="left:-1.45pt; top:0pt; width:470.9pt; height:0pt; border-top:solid 1.5pt #000000;"></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><span class="awspan awtext005" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Email</span><div class="awdiv" style="top:16.8pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click Upload Documents and you can upload the requested documents. </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:303.9pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:29.33pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Choose file</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:94.01pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> and you can choose file from the desktop. Click </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:352.14pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Upload</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:392.81pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> to send the </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">requested documents. </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:489.59pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click the check box ass shown below to accept or reject documents. Click </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:394.84pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Accept</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:434.86pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> Icon </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">and the document will be accepted. Click </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:220.79pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Reject </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:260.14pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Icon and the document will be </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">rejected. </span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:116.4pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:256.6pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="344"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,342.6333 L624.5,342.6333 L-0.5,342.6333 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:417.29pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:127.5pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="172"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,170.5 L624.5,170.5 L-0.5,170.5 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="awdiv awpage" style="width:612pt; height:792pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:36pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,26.3pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:311.3pt; top:14.13pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Sourcelead – Candidates Module</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:742pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,15pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:0pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Quick Reference Guide</span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:456.88pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">15</span><div class="awdiv" style="left:-1.45pt; top:0pt; width:470.9pt; height:0pt; border-top:solid 1.5pt #000000;"></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="top:273.3pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">To Add Documents click </span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:132.72pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Add Documents</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:224.72pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> and the pop-up will be displayed as shown </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">below. Click Edit/Delete to update or delete the documents. Click Search and you can </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">search the documents using grid search. </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:589.5pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click Upload button and select the document type. Browse the document from the </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">desktop then click on upload. Later the document will be saved in the list. View and </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">download the documents. Click close icon and Add documents popup will be closed.</span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:255.8pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="343"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,341.5667 L624.5,341.5667 L-0.5,341.5667 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:386.7pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:257.6pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="345"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,343.9667 L624.5,343.9667 L-0.5,343.9667 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="awdiv awpage" style="width:612pt; height:792pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:36pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,26.3pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:311.3pt; top:14.13pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Sourcelead – Candidates Module</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:742pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,15pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:0pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Quick Reference Guide</span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:456.88pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">16</span><div class="awdiv" style="left:-1.45pt; top:0pt; width:470.9pt; height:0pt; border-top:solid 1.5pt #000000;"></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="top:274.8pt;"><span class="awspan awtext005" style="left:0pt; top:12.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">References</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:303.6pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">References of the candidate will be displayed in the References list.</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:359.54pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">  </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:366.21pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click Add </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Reference</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:331.2pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Add Reference pop-up will be displayed. Click Edit/Delete To update or delete the </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">existing references.</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:104.05pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">  </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:110.72pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click Search you can search the references using grid search. </span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:257.8pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="346"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,344.2334 L624.5,344.2334 L-0.5,344.2334 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:444.59pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:255.6pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="343"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,341.3 L624.5,341.3 L-0.5,341.3 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="awdiv awpage" style="width:612pt; height:792pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:36pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,26.3pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:311.3pt; top:14.13pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Sourcelead – Candidates Module</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:742pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,15pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:0pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Quick Reference Guide</span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:456.88pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">17</span><div class="awdiv" style="left:-1.45pt; top:0pt; width:470.9pt; height:0pt; border-top:solid 1.5pt #000000;"></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click Add References and enter the reference details. Click Save button and the </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">References will be saved in the list. Click close icon and Add references popup will be </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">closed.</span><div class="awdiv" style="top:314.7pt;"><span class="awspan awtext005" style="left:0pt; top:12.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Comments</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:343.5pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Comments will be displayed in the Comments list. Click Add Comment to add </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top